        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    wages = 25000\n    social_security_medicare_rate = 0.0765\n    futa_wage_base = 7000\n    futa_rate = 0.06\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    social_security_medicare_tax = wages * social_security_medicare_rate * 2\n    futa_tax = min(wages, futa_wage_base) * futa_rate\n    total_tax = social_security_medicare_tax + futa_tax\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_tax)\n```",
